From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:45:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: zuma: add the ALIVE pin
 controller

Add zuma's ALIVE pin controller at 0x154d0000, controller 0 of the
driver's zuma data, with its ten banks (gpa0-gpa4, gpa6-gpa10) and its
wake-up interrupt controller. As in stock's live device tree, each of
the 50 pins has its own interrupt, SPI 10 to 59 in pin order, level
high. Like PERIC0 and HSI2UFS, the controller takes the bus-clock
stand-in, since zuma has no clock driver yet and ABL leaves the clock
running.

The power and volume keys are on this controller.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Brett-Michael Green <brett@bmgvisualtech.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/exynos/google/zuma-pinctrl.dtsi  | 133 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/zuma.dtsi   |  13 ++
 2 files changed, 146 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/zuma-pinctrl.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/zuma-pinctrl.dtsi
index 581cb8c8a..42e7e7f09 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/zuma-pinctrl.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/zuma-pinctrl.dtsi
@@ -7,6 +7,139 @@
 
 #include "gs101-pinctrl.h"
 
+&pinctrl_gpio_alive {
+	gpa0: gpa0-gpio-bank {
+		gpio-controller;
+		#gpio-cells = <2>;
+		interrupt-controller;
+		#interrupt-cells = <2>;
+		interrupt-parent = <&gic>;
+		interrupts = <GIC_SPI 10 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 11 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 12 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 13 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+	};
+
+	gpa1: gpa1-gpio-bank {
+		gpio-controller;
+		#gpio-cells = <2>;
+		interrupt-controller;
+		#interrupt-cells = <2>;
+		interrupt-parent = <&gic>;
+		interrupts = <GIC_SPI 14 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 15 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 16 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 17 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 18 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>,
+			     <GIC_SPI 19 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+	};
+
+	gpa2: gpa2-gpio-bank {
